      "notesHtml": "<ul><li><strong>HTML report matches your report.</strong> The exported HTML report now shows the same widgets, in the same order, as your report view, plus a short written debrief: what went well, what to look at, and what to try next. It is a single file that opens in any browser.</li><li><strong>New app icon.</strong> The taskbar, Start menu, and installer show the APITestCenter logo instead of the default one.</li><li><strong>Help bubbles no longer get cut off</strong> at the edge of a card.</li><li><strong>Usage counts: no means no.</strong> If you say no to usage counts, the app stops counting entirely and deletes any counts it was keeping. Details: <a href=\"https://apitestcenter.com/privacy.html\">https://apitestcenter.com/privacy.html</a></li></ul>\n<p>Already on 0.3.0? The app offers this update by itself (installer version); just restart when it asks. Coming from 0.2.0? Download and install this version once.</p>",
